{"id":"en_what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero","title":"What? My Janitor Dad Is An SSS Hero!","titleEn":"What? My Janitor Dad Is An SSS Hero!","description":"After spending twelve years frozen while protecting a city, Atlas—an SSS-rank awakener—comes back to discover that his wife has died and that his son Noah resents him for having been away. Concealing his identity as a janitor, he steps in to protect Noah from bullies, and his true power becomes clear when robots submit to him. The former villain reappears, this time commanding a more powerful Frost Titan. Father and son join forces in battle, and Atlas ultimately destroys the creature before returning home in time for his birthday.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Bonds","Karma Payback","Mystery","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87o8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87o8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87o8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87o8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_what-my-janitor-dad-is-an-sss-hero_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"s